WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:04.748
This video shows how to add a vehicle and its driver on a phone.

00:00:06.413 --> 00:00:13.493
Tap the menu button, open Transport and choose Vehicles. Tap Add Vehicle at the top right.

00:00:26.383 --> 00:00:34.807
Enter the number plate, LEC-4521, choose the type Van, enter 30 seats and the make, Toyota Hiace.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:53.550
Enter the driver's name, Rashid Mehmood, and phone number, then choose the route this vehicle serves, Route A - North Sector.

00:01:04.516 --> 00:01:10.708
Tap Add Vehicle. The new vehicle appears in the list with its driver and route.

00:01:27.682 --> 00:01:31.618
The vehicle is in the fleet list with its driver and route.
